{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/0a9c8bf139b52061e57819e94a474655.poster.avif?t=1763685026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/0a9c8bf139b52061e57819e94a474655.webm?t=1763685026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/0a9c8bf139b52061e57819e94a474655.mp4?t=1763685026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Witch in The Woods is a fantasy Yuri visual novel set in a world of magic and mystery with an emphasis on plot. Delve into a captivating narrative filled with monster encounters, hidden<strong> </strong>secrets, betrayal, love, and tenderness. Your choices will lead to different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 200,000 words and 14 endings waiting for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/a7ae54d1e24c6d88321b3bf8b3b45003.avif?t=1763685026\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/188e1e047e47d88af454cc33bcccd4f0.poster.avif?t=1763685026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/188e1e047e47d88af454cc33bcccd4f0.webm?t=1763685026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangerous Greywind Forest has long been avoided by all who dare to tread its path. According to legend, the forest is home to beings beyond the norm, more dangerous than wild beasts. Once inside, escape seems impossible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors abound of a malevolent family of witches who dwell deep within the forest, harvesting the blood of young girls for their dark arts. Though thought to have left Greywind Forest, one of these witches has now resurfaced.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nellie, driven by her motivations, enters the Greywind Forest. There, she crosses paths with the mesmerizing yet dangerous witch. What twists of fate await her in this fateful encounter?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mystical world of The Witch in the Woods and embark on an emotionally resonant journey. Uncover the mysteries  as you engage in thrilling fantasy adventures and heartwarming moments. Your decisions will lead to diverse and unforgettable outcomes. Will you uncover the secrets of the witches and unlock the potential for romance and friendship amidst the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/f33819a7b9af5053ed4f5c64d027a44d.avif?t=1763685026\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/1c617b482315c4d3b9a4cb96d36d7886.poster.avif?t=1763685026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/1c617b482315c4d3b9a4cb96d36d7886.webm?t=1763685026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Immerse yourself in a touching story set in a mysterious fantasy world, full of magic, surprises, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Embark on thrilling fantasy adventures and face monsters as you uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Enjoy 100 beautiful CGs that enhance the story and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Your choices matter! Experience the exciting story with branching paths and multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/422fdf558b4597d8eef8e40b40038086fb641e09.jpg"},{"name":"Her Own Choice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/78c3ce5e7040280215d4a543f4e56795a1124380.jpg"},{"name":"The Memory in The Lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/b77894b01e56373f7193a2b8876df6c477136dfc.jpg"},{"name":"Twisted Dream In The Lake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/7276ce9c32b7847ae74cd5dd005a4f1ce5753c74.jpg"},{"name":"The Truth Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/42f7c2c4a1e38f486f691a8bd45ce4b47405f2f7.jpg"},{"name":"Kaia's New Chapter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/a67fb7599d870d9029be44991c8189b4bd151f83.jpg"},{"name":"End 01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/16f52e225842599f4de12ab8e75e58f3b2b4a889.jpg"},{"name":"End 02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/836d0111b4137fa9a908bbc22e9d59583fb1b391.jpg"},{"name":"End 03","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2425680/870