ntures and heartwarming moments. Your decisions will lead to diverse and unforgettable outcomes. Will you uncover the secrets of the witches and unlock the potential for romance and friendship amidst the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/f33819a7b9af5053ed4f5c64d027a44d.avif?t=1763685026\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/1c617b482315c4d3b9a4cb96d36d7886.poster.avif?t=1763685026\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/extras/1c617b482315c4d3b9a4cb96d36d7886.webm?t=1763685026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Immerse yourself in a touching story set in a mysterious fantasy world, full of magic, surprises, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Embark on thrilling fantasy adventures and face monsters as you uncover hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Enjoy 100 beautiful CGs that enhance the story and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 Your choices matter! Experience the exciting story with branching paths and multiple endings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dream Nyght Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2425680/862018d20d94d0ef185b8e1113d5401d8a870b3a/header.jpg?t=1763